<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Anal vore-->
  <AnalDigest.RMBLabel>肛门 吃人</AnalDigest.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Anal digestion is where the predator is where the predator stuffs the prey up their butt and eventually to their stomach for fatal digestion, feeding the predator and turning the prey into either fertilizer components or nothing at all.-->
  <AnalDigest.description>肛门“消化” 是指捕食者将猎物塞进屁股里，最终送到胃里进行致命的消化，从而喂养捕食者，并将猎物转化为肥料成分，或者根本不吃。</AnalDigest.description>
  <!--EN: (Digest) Anal-->
  <AnalDigest.label>(摘要)肛门</AnalDigest.label>
  <!--EN: Oral vore-->
  <OralDigest.RMBLabel>用嘴 吃人</OralDigest.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Oral digestion is where the predator swallows the prey into their stomach for fatal digestion, feeding the predator and turning the prey into either fertilizer components or nothing at all.-->
  <OralDigest.description>用嘴消化是指捕食者将猎物吞噬入其胃内进行致命消化，喂养捕食者并将猎物转化为肥料成分或根本不吃。</OralDigest.description>
  <!--EN: (Digest) Oral-->
  <OralDigest.label>(摘要)用嘴</OralDigest.label>
</LanguageData>
